<!--
  Notification action icon: stop VPN (filled square), as opposed to the hollow
  power symbol used for disconnect.

  The two mean different things here and the icons have to say so at a glance:
  Disconnect tears down every Tor core and loses the bootstrap, Stop VPN only
  takes the device off Tor while the engine stays up. Using one icon for both
  would make the distinction invisible in the one place the user is choosing
  between them.
-->
